            "detailed_description": "<strong><u>Follow-me on TikTok to watch more gameplay clips, i will be posting more <br><br><strong><u>Here's a link to all my social media profiles and projects. If you choose to follow me, it means a lot!</u></strong><br><br><br>Step into the shoes of Richard Silver, a man that along with his brother David inherit their grandparents house where both were raised, after their grandparents mysterious death the brothers decide to start a makeover on the old house and then sell it, by the time Richard arrives at the house to help his brother, things slowly start to get out of hand...<br><br>Features:<br><br>3 different endings  Good, Bad, Evil<br>Examine and interact with the environment<br>Puzzles and Riddles<br>Pleasant graphics<br>Touching and creepy Soundtrack<br>Pay attention to every object in your surrounding, it may save your life later in your journey</u></strong>",
            "about_the_game": "<strong><u>Follow-me on TikTok to watch more gameplay clips, i will be posting more <br><br><strong><u>Here's a link to all my social media profiles and projects. If you choose to follow me, it means a lot!</u></strong><br><br><br>Step into the shoes of Richard Silver, a man that along with his brother David inherit their grandparents house where both were raised, after their grandparents mysterious death the brothers decide to start a makeover on the old house and then sell it, by the time Richard arrives at the house to help his brother, things slowly start to get out of hand...<br><br>Features:<br><br>3 different endings  Good, Bad, Evil<br>Examine and interact with the environment<br>Puzzles and Riddles<br>Pleasant graphics<br>Touching and creepy Soundtrack<br>Pay attention to every object in your surrounding, it may save your life later in your journey</u></strong>",
            "short_description": "Embark on a touching and creepy journey about sacrifice and how sometimes a person pays for the sins of another",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
